@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #139D90
 LifeLineBorderColor #A5BFC2
 ParticipantBackgroundColor #183840
 ParticipantBorderColor #183840
 ParticipantFontColor white
 ActorBorderColor #183840
 ActorFontColor #183840
 GroupBorderColor #139D90
 GroupBackgroundColor #EAF6F3
 GroupHeaderFontColor #183840
 NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1E7
 NoteBorderColor #F66B22
}
actor Student
participant Frontend as FE
participant "REST Controller" as API
participant IdentityService as S
database PostgreSQL as DB
title Shared protected-request guard
Student -> FE: Use protected action
FE -> API: HTTPS request to /api/v1/...\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_token>
API -> S: verifyTokenAndSession(token)
S -> S: Verify signature, issuer, audience and expiry
alt missing / invalid / expired JWT
 S --> API: UNAUTHORIZED
 API --> FE: 401 + ErrorEnvelope
else valid JWT
 S -> DB: Read account and session for verified sub
 DB --> S: Account / session state
 alt missing account or revoked session
  S --> API: UNAUTHORIZED
  API --> FE: 401 + ErrorEnvelope
 else account not ACTIVE or role not STUDENT
  S --> API: FORBIDDEN
  API --> FE: 403 + ErrorEnvelope
 else authorized
  S --> API: Verified principal (sub, STUDENT)
  API -> API: Continue selected module operation
 end
end
FE --> Student: Result or sign-in / permission message
note over S,DB: Database failure -> 500 ErrorEnvelope; no business operation runs.
@enduml
